    "created_at": "2016-01-19T10:22:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-19T10:22:43Z",
    "body": "Also the `srcset` `w` descriptor could be changed into a float.\n\nThere are also a number of legacy attributes (e.g. `width` on `table`), but we could leave those as integers.\n\n`img`, `video` and `input`'s `width` and `height` IDL attributes are `long`s currently; those should probably be changed to `double`s. Similarly for `img`'s `naturalWidth`/`naturalHeight` and `video`'s `videoWidth`/`videoHeight`.\n\nNeed to investigate closer what browsers do here and if there's Web compat problem with changing this.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
