    "updated_at": "2022-06-01T17:00:35Z",
    "body": "Both Firefox and Chrome do seem to respect decimals in width/height attributes already. I tried creating an ``<img>`` tag with a width of 50.5, and the inspector on both browsers does display the width as 50.5, same as if the fractional width was set via CSS. ",
